# Keep line endings identical on every platform.
#
# tools/package.py derives the build id from a hash of file CONTENTS, so a
# CRLF checkout on Windows and an LF checkout in CI would stamp different build
# ids on identical code — and an acceptance result is only meaningful if its
# build id is. Normalising here makes the id reproducible.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.qgz  binary
*.gpkg binary
*.zip  binary
